The terminal layout and interaction model (inline history in the terminal scrollback, a bottom
composer with a key-hint footer, a status line while working, condensed command cells, inline
approval prompts, popups for commands and models) are modeled on OpenAI Codex CLI's TUI:

  OpenAI Codex — https://github.com/openai/codex
  Copyright 2025 OpenAI
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The behavior was studied from that source and reimplemented independently in TypeScript with
Ink; no Codex source code or text is included in this package.

Bundled third-party packages (inlined into dist/xb.js) keep their own licenses, among them
Ink and its dependencies (MIT), React (MIT), the Model Context Protocol SDK (MIT), zod (MIT),
fast-glob (MIT), ignore (MIT) and jsdiff (BSD-3-Clause).

The orchid art is derived from a public-domain photograph of Ophrys caucasica by Nuvens
(Wikimedia Commons); see docs/brand/README.md.
